================================================================================
               POSTMAN CONFIGURATION GUIDE FOR THE 4 PARAMETERS
================================================================================

1. Query Parameters
   - URL Path: http://127.0.0.1:5000/query?name=Alice&age=30
   - Postman Location: Params tab (Automatically populates from the URL string).
   - Format: Entered as Key/Value rows directly under the URL bar.

2. JSON Parameters
   - URL Path: http://127.0.0.1:5000/json (or /post)
   - Postman Location: Body tab -> Select 'raw' radio button.
   - Format: Change dropdown on far right to 'JSON' -> Paste {"key": "value"}.

3. Form Data
   - URL Path: http://127.0.0.1:5000/form
   - Postman Location: Body tab -> Select 'form-data' radio button.
   - Format: Enter fields in the grid as Key: username | Value: Alice.

4. Headers
   - URL Path: http://127.0.0.1:5000/headers
   - Postman Location: Headers tab (Located between Params and Body).
   - Format: Scroll down to an empty row -> Key: X-API-Key | Value: secret123.
